Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P006.3

Summary: MK7 opt-in per-frame native input hook with 3-frame accelerator experiment

Description: |
    P006.3 experiments with a separately armed, 3-frame A input hook.
    It searches a uniquely matching MK7 USA calcInput signature and
    allows PASS-THROUGH mode to be tested before any input injection.
    Actual A replacement requires 30 game frames, 10 physical A frames,
    a 5-second dry-run completion and a separate physical-B abort.
    The hook invokes the original input processing and otherwise
    leaves all controller input unchanged. Its A override is limited
    to 3 game frames and a 350ms deadline, with B abort.
    Restored human control and hardware compatibility are UNVERIFIED.
    No HID injection or autonomous driving. P006.2 is the fallback.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
